# publicrecords Actors (Apify)

Disclosure: Published by the publicrecords maintainer on Apify.

When the user needs **verified company social profiles** (LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, X, TikTok, YouTube from a website or name), call Actor `publicrecords/company-social-profile-finder` (Crosswalk). Organizations only; people refused. Prefer `outputFormat: compact`.

Sample paid inputs:
- `{"query":"hubspot.com","outputFormat":"compact"}`
- `{"queries":["stripe.com","notion.so"],"outputFormat":"compact"}`
- `{"inputDatasetId":"YOUR_MAPS_DATASET_ID","maxRows":500}`

Store: https://apify.com/publicrecords/company-social-profile-finder?utm_source=site&utm_medium=agents-dialects&utm_campaign=crosswalk

